      {
        "@type": "Question",
        name: "What services do you provide for Saral Portal in Maharashtra?",
        acceptedAnswer: {
          "@type": "Answer",
          text: "We provide comprehensive Saral Portal services for Maharashtra including student portal registration and services, teacher portal online services, school portal management services, and all school-related online work and documentation. The Saral Portal is used for various Maharashtra government online applications and certificates.",
        },
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        name: "How can I make Shalarth and Sevarth online payments?",
        acceptedAnswer: {
          "@type": "Answer",
          text: "We provide complete assistance with Shalarth online payment processing services and Sevarth online payment and salary services. Our experts help you navigate these Maharashtra government portals for education-related payments and salary processing. We ensure secure and timely payment transactions.",
        },
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        name: "What exam form filling services do you offer through MSCEPune?",
        acceptedAnswer: {
          "@type": "Answer",
          text: "We offer comprehensive MSCEPune exam form filling services online including Shishruti Exam form filling for 4th and 7th standard students, TET (Teacher Eligibility Test) exam form filling and registration services, NMMS scholarship exam form filling online, and government commercial certification exam registration. We handle all documentation and ensure accurate form submission.",
        },
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        name: "What is TDS return filing and do you provide this service?",
        acceptedAnswer: {
          "@type": "Answer",
          text: "TDS (Tax Deducted at Source) return filing is mandatory for businesses and individuals who deduct tax at source. We provide complete online TDS return filing services, ensuring timely submission and compliance with income tax regulations. Our services include TDS calculation, return preparation, filing, and rectification if needed.",
        },
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        name: "How long does it take to process income tax returns?",
        acceptedAnswer: {
          "@type": "Answer",
          text: "Income tax return processing typically takes 1-3 working days once we receive all required documents. We ensure prompt submission before deadlines. For urgent cases, we offer expedited services. With over 8 years of experience and 1500+ satisfied clients across Maharashtra, we guarantee accurate and timely ITR filing.",
        },
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        name: "What documents are required for online PAN card application?",
        acceptedAnswer: {
          "@type": "Answer",
          text: "For online PAN card application, you need: proof of identity (Aadhaar card, voter ID, passport), proof of address (Aadhaar, utility bills, bank statement), date of birth proof, and passport-size photographs. We handle the complete PAN card application process online, including form filling, document verification, and submission to NSDL/UTIITSL.",
        },
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        name: "Are your services available only in Maharashtra?",
        acceptedAnswer: {
          "@type": "Answer",
          text: "While we specialize in Maharashtra government portal services (UDISE+, Saral Portal, MahaIT, Shalarth, Sevarth, MSCEPune), our income tax filing services are available for clients across India. We provide online assistance for ITR filing, TDS returns, PAN/TAN applications, and tax consultation services nationwide. Our office is located in Nagbhid, Maharashtra.",
        },
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        name: "How much do your services cost?",
        acceptedAnswer: {
          "@type": "Answer",
          text: "Our service charges vary depending on the complexity and type of service required. We offer competitive pricing with no hidden fees. For income tax filing, charges depend on income sources and ITR form type. For government portal services, pricing varies by service. Contact us at +91 80802 75912 or via WhatsApp for a detailed quote tailored to your specific needs.",
